# Chinese translation, generated from the project's translation table.

msg-chase00-0 = 
    Hearts pumping, you run down the street, shouldering aside bystanders and knocking over bales of goods. Dogs bark, cats yowl, and women point and shriek. Behind you, the guards come pounding in hot pursuit. <br><p>
    你决定去 ...<br><p><p><opt>...<indent>继续奔跑，希望能甩开守卫。<br><p><opt-battle>...<indent>抽出武器，转身应战。<br><p><opt>...<indent>试图设下埋伏，诱使卫兵自投罗网。<br><p><opt>...<indent>趴在拐角处藏身，盼守卫从旁掠过。<br><p><opt-items>...<indent>grab an alchemical potion and toss it behind you, hoping it stops the guards. <br><p><opt>...<indent>停下奔跑，投降吧。
msg-chase00-1 = 
    Proudly you stand over the defeated forms of the hapless guards. Turning your backs on them, you walk off into the deserted city streets.{" "}
msg-chase00-2 = 
    砍杀敌军，你奔入城中深处，将残余守卫远远甩在身后。
msg-chase00-3 = 
    Broken-hearted, you must flee the guards. They run after you for a short while, taunting, but soon tire of the sport and leave you to escape in peace.{" "}
msg-chase00-4 = 
    You must surrender to the guards. They take you prisoner and parade you to the dungeon, there to await the pleasure of the magistrate.{" "}
msg-chase00-5 = 
    药剂骤然喷涌，直扑守卫面门，使其暂时失明，汝得以安然脱身。
msg-chase00-6 = 
    Clouds of smoke obscure the route you take. The guards choose a wrong alley to run down, and you soon leave them far behind.{" "}
msg-chase00-7 = 
    怒气冲冲，药剂倾泻于鹅卵石路面，将街道化作一团黏稠的胶状物。守卫们被这混乱场面阻滞不前。其中一些胆大者冒险踏入，却发现自己牢牢粘在地面上。你将他们抛在身后，兀自思索着这炼金术的奇迹。
msg-chase00-8 = 
    While running along at top speed, $ChosenOneName tries to pull out an alchemical vial. He fumbles and drops it onto the street, where it bounces without breaking and rolls under a wagon. You have no time to retrieve it -- the guards are much too close. Cursing, you run onward.{" "}
msg-chase00-9 = 
    你避过卫兵，钻入巷弄，藏于柴堆后。卫兵增援，搜查良久，终未寻获。待夜深，你悄然离巷。
msg-chase00-10 = 
    你避过卫兵，钻入巷弄，藏于柴堆后。卫兵增援，搜查良久，终未寻获。待黎明，卫兵放弃，你始离巷。
msg-chase00-11 = 
    跃至一垛方便的柴堆后，你几乎成功躲过了追来的卫兵。但这时可怜的老$ChosenOneName打了个喷嚏。瞬间，卫兵们便围了上来，刀剑出鞘。
msg-chase00-12 = 
    You run down the street, turn a corner, and then quickly press yourselves against the wall, drawing your weapons. When the guards come running past, you hurl yourselves upon them. Surprise is complete.{" "}
msg-chase00-13 = 
    你沿街疾跑，转过街角，随即紧贴墙边，拔出武器，面向大道。可惜你们都算错了一点：追兵竟从反方向杀来！伏击计划彻底落空，很快你们便陷入激战。
msg-chase00-14 = 
    你拼命奔逃，却始终甩不掉追兵。他们虽慢，却步步逼近。最终你只得转身迎战。你已无路可退。追兵小心了！
msg-chase00-15 = 
    仿佛奔跑了许久，你终于甩开了守卫。气喘吁吁、咳嗽不止，你倚靠在一栋建筑上，努力平复呼吸。这段时间里，你已见识了不少$PlaceName的后巷——可惜当时无暇欣赏这趟“游览”！
